            <div xml:id="d594">

                <pb facs="0702" n="582" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg582"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00 Revolutions/194: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-06-27T11:00:00-06:00">June 27, 1931—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>135. I have been informed officially that Ferrera was killed yesterday by
                    Government troops near San Pedro Sula.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lay</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
